position = Vector2( 256, 768 )
roomName = "Tram Station"
roomDescription = "You walk about the lower half of the tram station. The area is eerily empty, with nobody around. The air is heavy with a sense of dust and dread as the purple lined walls tell you're in the Lilac Block. The odd atmosphere is enough to make you question why you're here...

Currently you're stood right next to one of the signs used to help inmates and staff figure out where they're going. Considering you're part of the general block, you can only access the cell blocks. You take note that each block is divided by color, orange signifying general, red signifying... red, and pink signifiying lilacs."
