roomDescription = "You roam the main hall of the lilac block. This area is significantly altered from the usual block structure, and you can't tell if the lilacs did that themselves or if they paid the prison engineers to do it for them. In either case, the area is absolutely huge. To the north is the living quarters, housing all of the \"cells.\" To the east is the Sex Market, where lilacs will whore themselves out or sell various lewd goods. To the west is the Bazaar District, but it's more like a black market, dealing with contraband and other things that would definitely get you sent to solitary... or worse.

In the center of the room is the throne, where the Lilac Queen sits, watching you roam."
roomColor = 4
population = 3

