roomName = "Upper Tram Station"
roomDescription = "You walk about the upper half of the tram station. The area is eerily empty, with nobody around. The air is heavy with a sense of dust and dread as the purple lined walls tell you're in the Lilac Block. The odd atmosphere is enough to make you question why you're here..."
